 journey begins now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/idle.gif?t=1743355951\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/sprite.gif?t=1743355951\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your main weapon, a big axe, to defeat enemies. Collect exploding potions and use them agains your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/mov22.gif?t=1743355951\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vast world full of discoveries awaits you! Explore 24 different  levels across five unique worlds, each presenting exciting challenges. From endless desert landscapes and dense forests to majestic mountains and mysterious castles \u2013 experience breathtaking locations and embrace every adventure.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/scn1.png?t=1743355951\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BOSSFIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use all your skills to defeat powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/boss.gif?t=1743355951\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEET HELPERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet friendly characters, which you can play and use new weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/ranger.gif?t=1743355951\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/extras/druid.gif?t=1743355951\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY WITH A FRIEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In co-op multiplayer mode, you can enjoy your adventure with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE AWAITS YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins to purchase powerful items from merchants. Hidden diamonds and various achievements will keep you engaged even after you've completed the game.</p>","developers":["Castle Village Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984260/header.jpg?t=1743355951","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(C) 2024 Castle Village Games GmbH","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256948143,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail